  <Description>
    <LocalizedDescription Lang="en-US"><![CDATA[Queued MAM Positive with Preceding Axis Position Feedforward ]]></LocalizedDescription>
  </Description>
  <RevisionNote>
    <LocalizedRevisionNote Lang="en-US"><![CDATA[V3.0
simplified code
simplified interface
tolerance on target position
V3.1
change conditions for IP]]></LocalizedRevisionNote>
  </RevisionNote>
  <AdditionalHelpText>
    <LocalizedAdditionalHelpText Lang="en-US"><![CDATA[This instruction targets a destination for a specific Mover. It checks wheter this target is reachable or not, drive Mover to the closest position (specified by input parameter) and, if left active, wait for the queue
to proceed until it reaches its destination. The target position may be updated during movement, and additional movement, such as Position Cams or MDSC Moves or Jogs can be added on top.]]></LocalizedAdditionalHelpText>
  </AdditionalHelpText>
